{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">番茄食譜｜這道「番茄薯仔腸仔炒免治牛」非常適合炎炎夏日，是一道極具開胃效果的家庭小菜。肥媽巧妙利用雪櫃剩餘的免治牛肉和雞肉腸，稍作變通便能炮製出一大碟豐富美味的佳餚。這道菜不僅十分「惹味」下飯，更是大人和小朋友的最愛！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b552edbe-cad7-4933-a3c9-d206a130cc45.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026DAXm7XOcio1785126762.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b552edbe-cad7-4933-a3c9-d206a130cc45.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材準備</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>製作步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>實用小貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0d36d5c3-3d3b-47c0-bab6-f3ca875a19cb.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026nBcsaohrsg1785126762.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0d36d5c3-3d3b-47c0-bab6-f3ca875a19cb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T09:00:12.250349+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}